<b>You want to know who could’ve done it?</b> He sighs, crossing his arms. <b>I don’t know. I don’t talk much with the others. They all have their own lives, their own business.</b> 
His brow furrows slightly. <b>But whoever it was… I don’t think it was random. That wasn’t just an act of violence—it was intentional. Precise.</b>
